Type: Shiny
Title: SLC Flight Network Explorer
Version: 2.0.0
Description: A Shiny application for exploring the historical network of
    airports and airlines connected to Salt Lake City International Airport.
    The app displays airport locations, route lines, flight-count classes,
    selected-airport details, and annual and monthly time series using
    precomputed slcflights-derived data. The deployed app reads prepared
    .rds files and does not import slcflights at runtime.
Imports:
    bslib,
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    plotly,
    RColorBrewer,
    sf,
    shiny,
    units
